Fix a crash when inferring an attribute that resolves to a method proxying
something other than a function. A class attribute bound to another class'
``lambda`` method raised ``AttributeError`` (``Lambda`` has no
``decoratornames``), and a method proxying ``Uninferable`` raised ``TypeError``,
while ``_is_property`` inspected the method's decorators.

Refs #3370
Refs pylint-dev/pylint#10345
